WEBVTT

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.010
Couldn't you have died...

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:36.150
after I'd eaten you?

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:59.560
Tuxedo Blowing in the Wind

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:17.360
Excuse me, could I have something to eat?

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.730
Are you one of them?!

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:31.040
No! So please don't shoot!

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:32.770
What'd you come here for?

00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:34.110
I'm a tourist.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:35.480
In a tuxedo?

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:36.840
Get lost!

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:38.010
Yeah...

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:38.870
Wait!

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:41.310
Leave your valuables while you're at it.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.150
You got a problem with that?

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:44.280
No, I don't.

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:45.950
Come here.

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:48.150
Yeah, sure thing.

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:56.360
You're the ones who did this?

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:57.830
You got a problem with that?

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:01.790
Oh, no... That's not what I meant...

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:05.630
They drew first. It was self-defense.

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:07.840
You don't want to end up the same way, do you?

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:10.310
Then keep quiet and give us everything you've got.

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:12.440
The tuxedo too!

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:14.880
Sorry, but that's...

00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:16.850
You complaining again, huh?

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:19.990
Oh, sorry about that. Didn't mean to.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:20.750
You!

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:21.810
Oh, I don't mean to.

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.600
Sorry. I don't mean to.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:48.280
I didn't mean to...

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:53.780
Thanks. You saved me.

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:57.460
I wasn't trying to save you.

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:00.920
I'm Wendy.

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:06.420
People call me... Van the...

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:16.810
Oh, you're awake?

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:18.850
You must be hungry.

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:21.020
I'll treat you to something for saving me.

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.320
Open please.

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:27.980
Yep.

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:41.210
Wendy! What about the others?

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:43.540
The Wild Bunch...

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:46.840
I see. But you made it back OK.

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:48.380
You must have been scared.

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:51.880
I'm sorry. The others weren't...

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:54.720
Yeah, we'll take care of them.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:03:59.180
Is the mayor around?

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:03.190
They're called the "Wild Bunch".

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:05.520
I think it was about two months ago...

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:07.650
they suddenly showed up here.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:11.490
The robbing and looting began the day they arrived.

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:14.990
Only the people who took refuge in this mall have managed to survive.

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:18.490
They're still hanging out near the town's entrance...

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:21.000
and they've got their sights set on the huge vault here.

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:24.080
The police station was burned down.

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.290
We can't even make contact with nearby towns.

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:31.050
The people still left have resisted...

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:33.670
but their numbers are dwindling.

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:37.720
There are no young people left anymore.

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:40.760
Rubens, the one who put together the citizens patrol group...

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:42.430
is now in a coffin in the church.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:43.680
And Michael...

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:44.560
Mayor...

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:49.190
Michael is Wendy's older brother.

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:51.860
The two of them were close, but...

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:54.030
a week ago he was taken away.

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:55.570
I hope he's still alive, but...

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:58.780
Here's the dressing to go with it.

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:04.330
That's... for the salad.

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:08.380
As long as we're in the mall, we're safe.

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:09.790
They can't get to us here.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:13.960
But we have to settle this sometime soon.

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:17.890
We can't afford to lose any more people...

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:21.720
- Like I said, we can't afford to...

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.060
- Like I said, we can't afford to...
- It's good!

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:25.270
Do you have any milk?

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:28.440
The cows were the first things they made off with.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:30.110
But we do have wine, if you'd like...

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:33.190
Oh, no. Water's fine.

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:34.070
So then...

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:38.070
will you be our bodyguard? We'll feed you and pay you.

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:39.240
What do you say?

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:44.410
Why is he wearing a tuxedo?

00:05:52.090 --> 00:05:54.000
Day after day, they keep coming back.

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:57.380
You rats squirming in your stinking ditchwater!

00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:00.680
Heed our lord, Lucky the Roulette.

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:04.930
For man, each day is a test.

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:10.690
Desire, dreams, and fate all trying him.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:16.280
Only the man who does not run away from those things can obtain luck.

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:20.490
How about me?

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:22.700
How about today?

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:30.330
Another lucky day!

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:31.920
Lucky!

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:37.170
Lucky! Lucky! Lucky!

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:43.260
I'll tell you how it is.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:46.350
In this world there are two things which are equal.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:50.940
One is death. And the other is luck!

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:55.320
The two will be coming together to this town tomorrow!

00:06:56.400 --> 00:07:00.320
You've disregarded our negotiations up until today!

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:03.910
You should pay the price for it.

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:05.450
What's that?

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:13.790
How's that?

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:16.590
Strike!

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:19.130
What is it?

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:20.630
Remember well!

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:23.050
This is the power of the Armor!

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:25.100
The Armor?

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:28.640
Your defense is over!

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:30.850
Your luck has run out!

00:07:31.230 --> 00:07:33.690
The Armor will come tomorrow night!

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:37.110
Surrender and give up the vault by then!

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:40.690
Don't press your luck! It's pointless! You got it?

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:45.120
That's your only "Survival Lucky Road"!

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:47.870
That's all Lord Lucky has for today.

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:56.790
I'm begging you! Be our bodyguard!

00:07:57.460 --> 00:08:00.300
There's no way of knowing if we'll be safe even if we surrender!

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:02.970
You can have whatever you want! Money! Women!

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:05.550
But we need you now! Before the Armor arrives!

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:07.970
You have to do something about Lucky tonight!

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:10.850
Do it yourself.

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:12.730
It's cheaper.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:15.350
Wait! Please wait!

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:17.730
Van!

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:26.370
So what kind of a guy was he?

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:29.080
He wore a tuxedo and a hat.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:30.790
He used a strange sword.

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:32.370
He came out of nowhere but...

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:34.870
he didn't seem to be coming to their aid.

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:39.420
It's him...

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:42.880
Give me a milk. Make it a large.

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:46.590
What's your name?

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:47.680
Van...

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:52.560
Well now, I've heard of the Van who's out of work...

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:54.060
and the Van who eats without paying the bill...

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:56.310
and the crybaby Van from hell.

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:57.560
But which one are you?

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:00.980
None of them. I'm just plain Van.

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:03.650
I see. So what did you come here for?

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:05.490
Like I said, I came for a drink of milk...

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:09.450
All right, all right.

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:11.490
Come on over here, Van.

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:13.620
Let's play together.

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:23.090
We'll take the cards off the top one by one.

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:25.510
The one who pulls the joker loses.

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:29.890
We'll see who's the lucky one, me or you.

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:33.680
I just wanted a drink of milk but...

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:38.560
I'll let you drown yourself in it, after we're done with this.

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:41.020
All right, you go first.

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:44.150
Why are you so concerned with luck?

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:47.240
It's the only thing which is in God's domain.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:51.740
There's no training, or polishing one's skills.

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:54.330
That's why I want to test it.

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:59.040
I want to find out what God thinks of me, get it?

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:00.500
Whatever...

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:07.880
Why the hell do we have to stand guard?

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:19.730
If I win...

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:21.730
can I leave here safely?

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:26.030
I won't let anyone else interfere with you.

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:29.740
And I only shoot people from the front.

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:32.030
That's my personal code.

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:36.040
Luck doesn't come to those who shoot people in the back.

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:39.750
That's a relief. Turn over the card.

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:45.380
The one who draws The joker loses, right?

00:10:51.090 --> 00:10:52.590
Don't scare me.

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:55.600
Two cards left.

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:57.390
Oh, that's too bad...

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:58.350
Too bad for me.

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:01.980
You win.

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:04.690
Lucky!

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:08.110
Lucky! Lucky! Lucky!

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:11.150
You're a good man, Van.

00:11:11.780 --> 00:11:14.120
You've got guts, and you're brave.

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:17.120
I'll forget about what happened at the church.

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:19.580
Right. And I'd like some milk as well.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:22.460
Unfortunately...

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:26.630
I like people who are more willing to cater to my immediate interests.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:28.800
Throw him out!

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:31.930
Serves you right!

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:34.300
Save your luck, why don't you?

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:37.930
Get the hell outta here, you freak!

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:00.580
It's not fair!

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:01.120
What?

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:04.250
Why won't you help us if you're so strong?

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:05.460
It's not fair.

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.090
There's nothing unfair.

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:12.220
Now listen, it's my decision what I do for whoever.

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:15.840
There's no reason for me to protect you people right now.

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:17.100
You're so cruel!

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:18.850
I'm not cruel.

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:23.060
Think about what you can do yourself.

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:27.480
I can do something.

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:31.030
I'II...

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:34.910
I'll be your...

00:12:35.950 --> 00:12:37.530
Your bride!

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:45.710
Huh?! What's that?!

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:48.000
I'm saying I'll marry you!

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:50.340
Marriage? That's not what I'm talking about!

00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:52.420
You're going to desert your wife and go?!

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:55.720
Do you know what a wife is?!

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:58.220
I know...

00:12:58.220 --> 00:12:59.260
about half of it.

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:00.640
Half is no good.

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:02.560
I'll study the rest.

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:03.850
Who's going to teach you?

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:09.230
I'm a virgin!

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:11.570
I am too!

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:13.070
Don't say that! It's not decent!

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.070
What about your parents?

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:17.030
They're long since gone.

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:21.370
Look here, that's not it.

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:24.750
Becoming a bride is a happy thing.

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:28.210
It should be the happiest moment in your life.

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:33.300
Get out of town by tomorrow night.

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:36.430
I can't do that.

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:40.720
How am I supposed to wait for my brother...

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:42.720
if I leave town?

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:53.110
That's a good look for you.

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:57.860
Hey. I'll be taking my luck back!

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:31.400
You all are getting out of here too?

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:33.400
There's no one stupid enough to wait...

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:34.900
when they say the Armor's coming tonight.

00:14:35.230 --> 00:14:36.650
What are you saying?!

00:14:36.650 --> 00:14:39.360
How are we supposed to go on living if they take the money?

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:41.950
Being alive is what matters, right?

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:43.990
It's better to give up quick.

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:46.330
Are the money and the town so important?

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:59.930
Good morning! Wake up everybody!

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:01.710
The Wild Bunch has started their attack.

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:04.220
This fortress is our last stand... Big brother...

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:06.070
protect us!

00:15:08.730 --> 00:15:11.560
It's time again today for Lord Lucky!

00:15:12.650 --> 00:15:14.940
My Armor has come.

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:20.200
Those who did not listen to my advice are the unlucky ones!

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:23.660
So I give you death!

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:27.290
And for us, happiness.

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:29.580
Jack it up! Jack it up!

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:30.460
Open it all the way!

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:31.960
Check the gas pressure!

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:34.380
Oil level 4000!

00:15:34.380 --> 00:15:36.670
Set it within 100!

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:39.260
At 10,000 revolutions!

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:41.550
Armor...

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:46.760
Lucky time!

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:07.080
I'll take this as a souvenir.

00:16:08.990 --> 00:16:11.000
Give me my brother back!

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:14.040
I'm the only lucky one today.

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:20.760
I'll let you watch the destruction of your town...

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:22.760
from your own special seat!

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:31.350
Lucky! Lucky! Lucky!

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:33.020
Stop it!

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:34.770
Watch closely!

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:38.440
I'll teach you! Luck is life!

00:16:41.030 --> 00:16:42.490
Stop.

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:04.420
Why?

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:05.720
Van.

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:09.760
I've decided. For the girl's sake...

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:13.890
I'm gonna hack away your luck until there's nothing left!

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:16.730
Get me my luck back!

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:28.870
My luck...

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:29.780
You!

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:34.080
Grab your weapons! Protect the town!

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:37.960
Let's give it a try.

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:40.460
You're interfering with my luck?

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:49.260
You shot at me from behind.

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:51.680
Was your code a lie?

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:55.520
Shut up, unlucky!

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:58.520
I won't let you keep the luck you stole from me!

00:18:00.940 --> 00:18:02.650
Lucky or die.

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:10.410
My Armor...

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:11.910
Oh shit!

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:12.990
Our leader's snapped!

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:14.580
Invincible!

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:16.200
Wonderful!

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:18.120
Comfortable!

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:25.670
This is no good.

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:27.260
He'll blow away everything including the safe!

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:33.850
Now do you understand?

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:36.100
Luck is only for me.

00:18:36.100 --> 00:18:37.060
Wrong.

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:42.110
Someone who breaks his word like you...

00:18:42.110 --> 00:18:44.360
doesn't get a second chance.

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:52.410
Shut up, unlucky!

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:15.390
It can't be...

00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:23.690
Another Armor?

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:24.190
Van?

00:19:24.610 --> 00:19:28.070
It can't be! You're an Armor rider too?

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:38.330
Wake up, Dann.

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:48.760
My luck!

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:50.720
Give me my luck back!

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:52.470
Please!

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:53.680
I don't want to.

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:05.940
Don't come any closer, unlucky!

00:20:13.030 --> 00:20:16.240
My luck hasn't run out yet!

00:20:23.710 --> 00:20:25.880
There's no escape in mid-air!

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:27.750
Disappear!

00:20:28.090 --> 00:20:29.050
Go away!

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:30.420
Break apart and disperse!

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:32.340
Unlucky!

00:20:33.010 --> 00:20:34.720
Chesuto!

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:45.730
How could you?!

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:48.480
The unlucky one... is you.

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:01.200
Where's my brother?

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:02.660
We sold him off.

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:05.370
He told us to bring him along.

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:06.120
Who?

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:09.340
The man with the claw on his right hand.

00:21:10.670 --> 00:21:11.630
The claw!

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:18.720
Where?! Where is he?!

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:19.760
I don't know!

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:20.810
Where?!

00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:22.020
I'm telling you the truth.

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:24.770
My team and my luck are gone, so why would I lie.

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:26.730
I'm asking you where he is!

00:21:28.190 --> 00:21:29.020
Van!

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:30.480
Van!

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:43.700
As long as we have this, we can rebuild somehow.

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:46.500
Everyone will come back, won't they?

00:21:46.500 --> 00:21:47.290
Yes.

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:52.250
Oh, speaking of which, what about those two?

00:21:52.800 --> 00:21:53.550
To tell you the truth...

00:21:56.340 --> 00:21:58.840
It's been a long time since I've seen such a beautiful sun.

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:00.850
The sun's always the same.

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:03.180
No. Today's special.

00:22:04.390 --> 00:22:06.140
You brought it with you.

00:22:10.400 --> 00:22:11.400
I like that.

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:14.570
All right, from now on I'm "Van of the Dawn".

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:16.110
Well then...

00:22:25.410 --> 00:22:27.250
Hey, I was thinking...

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:28.620
What?

00:22:28.830 --> 00:22:30.830
Since we're both after the same person...

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:32.670
shouldn't we go together?

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:37.420
I've left word with the Mayor that I'm leaving town.

00:22:37.630 --> 00:22:39.300
And two people would be better than one.

00:22:39.300 --> 00:22:40.090
Go back.

00:22:40.430 --> 00:22:41.140
No.

00:22:41.640 --> 00:22:42.890
Go on home, you little brat.

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:44.890
Don't treat me like a child.

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:49.440
Because I'm ready to be your wife at any time.

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:55.150
You don't understand anything.

00:22:55.280 --> 00:22:57.490
You're a disgrace to the good name of all true wives.

00:22:57.490 --> 00:22:59.320
What's in a name? It's better to be together.

00:23:00.700 --> 00:23:01.610
Hey, Van.

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:02.660
No.

00:23:02.660 --> 00:23:03.490
Van...

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:04.580
You don't give up, do you?

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:05.290
Van.

00:23:05.290 --> 00:23:06.040
Shut up!

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:11.170
Why are you in a tuxedo?

00:23:51.370 --> 00:23:52.540
Funny Stream

00:23:52.540 --> 00:23:55.750
And so Van and I headed off on our journey.
Funny Stream

00:23:55.750 --> 00:23:56.630
Funny Stream

00:23:56.630 --> 00:24:00.970
We encountered many people along the way...
Funny Stream

00:24:00.970 --> 00:24:03.340
but Carmen was the first.
Funny Stream

00:24:03.340 --> 00:24:04.300
Funny Stream

00:24:04.300 --> 00:24:06.300
We became ensnarled in a terrible disturbance...
Funny Stream

00:24:06.300 --> 00:24:08.640
as soon as we met her.
Funny Stream

00:24:08.640 --> 00:24:11.770
Yes, that's right. Carmen99.
Funny Stream

00:24:11.770 --> 00:24:12.560
Funny Stream

00:24:12.560 --> 00:24:17.380
The lady who has 99 secrets and a 99 centimeter bust.
Funny Stream

00:24:17.380 --> 00:24:17.400
The lady who has 99 secrets and a 99 centimeter bust.
